  "text": "Recipe: Air Fried Tofu Pakoda\nCreator: Padma Subramanian\nCategory: Snack\nIngredients: plant based yogurt, date syrup, besan, chickpea flour, red chilly powder, garlic powder, onion powder, turmeric powder, salt, tofu\nCooking methods: air-fry\nInstructions: CHICKPEA BATTER: Whisk together 2 Tbsp plant based yogurt and 1 tsp date syrup. Add 3 Tbsp besan (chickpea flour), 1 tsp red chilly powder, 1 tsp garlic powder, 1 tsp onion powder, 1/2 tsp turmeric powder and salt to taste. Mix well.\nTOFU PAKODA: Drain & cube a block of tofu. Combine these cubes with Chickpea Batter. Rest for 10 mins. Then air fry at 400 F till crispy.\nNotes: A recipe with BEANS (chickpea flour, tofu), NUTS & SEEDS (plant-based yogurt), SWEETENER (date syrup), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
